      "category": "justified-exception",
      "reason": "JUSTIFIED: same un-fusing as the row above, with a capability token in the compound variant: once free is peelable the trailing scan reaches omni too, so variant \"omni-free\" (version empty) becomes variant \"v\" at version 2 with modifiers omni,free. omni stays IDENTITY-class, so it remains in the entity key; only the pricing tier leaves it. Version goes empty -\u003e 2 and family is preserved."
