      "reason": "JUSTIFIED: same un-fusing as the omni row, with the pro tier token: variant \"pro-free\" (version empty) becomes variant \"v\" at version 2 with modifiers pro,free. pro is globally IDENTITY-class (the safe over-split for an AMBIGUOUS token) and stays in the key; only free leaves it."
    },
    {
      "provider": "opencode",
      "id": "mimo-v2.5-free",
