      "category": "justified-exception",
      "reason": "JUSTIFIED: the free demotion exposes the version the fused suffix was hiding: variant \"v2.5-free\" (version empty) becomes variant \"v\" at version 2.5 with free as an attribute modifier. Family is preserved and no populated field is emptied — the version slot goes from empty to populated, which is the taxonomy invariant this gate exists to protect."
    },
    {
      "provider": "opencode",
      "id": "minimax-m3-free",
