      "category": "justified-exception",
      "reason": "JUSTIFIED: the aihubmix spelling of the mimo 2.5 Pro free tier. Its upstream raw family is \"mimo-v2.5-pro\" (the free suffix appears only in the model id), so the BEFORE tuple fused the whole version+tier into the variant slot with no version at all. After the demotion it decomposes to variant \"v\" at version 2.5 with modifiers pro,free — and, being the same tuple the opencode mimo-v2.5-pro-free row now reaches, it CONVERGES two providers' spellings of one model rather than worsening either."
